ompatibility passes.\n\nDecision: candidate remains uncommitted, issue stays open. The GC-enabled interpreter microbenchmark gain does not justify claiming a full-suite win or overlooking the repeated method_call wall regression. Next investigation should isolate process startup and deferred compile costs in method_call, including GC-disabled control and execution scheduling; do not infer a cause from the trace-only medians. Preserve benchmark-first ordering and cold/idle gating.","files":null}]}